# Signature limit

A single signature suffices for purchases up to one thousand (1000) EUR only. This limit is set by the CFO directive of 1 July 2026 and applies until further notice.[[cite:obs-3afce953e4a41020627be9af58a82190db3dd99c "Until further notice a single signature suffices for purchases up to one thousand (1000) EUR only."]]

Where the CFO directive and the procurement policy differ, the CFO directive applies.[[cite:obs-3afce953e4a41020627be9af58a82190db3dd99c "Until further notice a single signature suffices for purchases up to one thousand (1000) EUR only."]]
